  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 9ae4abe13f (fx_sobun: class Foo with LIMIT, @@count, attr_reader :name, @name/@size set in initialize). Survey emits fields Foo::LIMIT, Foo::@@count and Foo#name (from attr_reader) and no field for @size. ruby.py has no instance_variable handling. The design call is still open; premise holds. MECHANISM: ruby analyzer emits field symbols only for class-body constants, @@class-vars and attr_* calls; method-body @ivar assignments are never visited as declarations."  # 70fc
